  "conclusion": "EXP-07 conclusively establishes BallTracker V2 as the production ball tracking architecture. By implementing multi-ball lifecycle management, bounded spatial gating (500px cap with 35px/frame growth), anchor consistency validation, and verified-detection emission (zero hallucination gap policy), BallTracker V2 overcomes the interpolation degradation diagnosed in EXP-06, resolves replacement-ball identity switches, and generalizes successfully to unseen holdout sequences."
